
"smart_sources:2023-12-07 - Idaho law forced women out of state for abortions. They detail ‘grim’ experiences (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607281815).md": {"path":"2023-12-07 - Idaho law forced women out of state for abortions. They detail ‘grim’ experiences (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607281815).md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"2q9cya","at":1785795029262},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1785284486979,"size":11050,"at":1785795029300,"hash":"2q9cya"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,10],"#":[11,42],"###Health problems spur terminations of pregnancies":[43,66],"###Health problems spur terminations of pregnancies#{1}":[45,66],"###With new pregnancies, women worry about health care":[67,103],"###With new pregnancies, women worry about health care#{1}":[69,103]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Ryan Suppe","target":"Ryan Suppe","line":5},{"title":"Nicole Blanchard","target":"Nicole Blanchard","line":6},{"title":"Idaho","target":"Idaho","line":11},{"title":"passed an exception","target":"https://legislature.idaho.gov/sessioninfo/2023/legislation/h0374/","line":27},{"title":"sue the state","target":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/news/politics-government/state-politics/article279248484.html","line":35},{"title":"for emergency exceptions","target":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/news/politics-government/state-politics/article279932504.html","line":37},{"title":"Rebecca Vincen-Brown, of Kuna, had to travel outside of Idaho earlier this year for an abortion after doctors determined that her baby had a usually fatal genetic abnormality called triploidy.","target":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/public/latest-news/qsvla2/picture282523158/alternates/FREE_1200/BOI_113005abortionplaintiff","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"Jennifer Adkins, of Caldwell, is suing Idaho over its strict abortion law. Adkins, a mother, found out her pregnancy was not viable and threatened her health. She obtained an abortion in Oregon.","target":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/public/latest-news/d8b3os/picture281356063/alternates/FREE_1200/1101%2002%20abortion%20plaintiffs.jpg","line":63,"embedded":true},{"title":"Rebecca Vincen-Brown comforts her daughter Winter, 2, on the playground at Bernie Fisher Park in Kuna.","target":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/public/latest-news/gz8xga/picture282523143/alternates/FREE_1200/BOI_113004abortionplaintiff","line":93,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"Idaho law forced women out of state for abortions. They detail ‘grim’ experiences","source":"https://www.idahostatesman.com/news/politics-government/state-politics/article281103713.html","author":["[[Ryan Suppe]]","[[Nicole Blanchard]]"],"published":"2023-12-07","created":"2026-07-22","description":"One woman said that as she faced painful contractions, she stifled her cries to avoid waking her daughter, who was sleeping in the family’s hotel room.","tags":["#idaho"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},